# What M&T supplied to build the brand from: their logo file and a screenshot of
# their own website (1.3 MB). Kept on disk as the record of where the palette in
# styles.css was sampled from, and kept out of git because the deploy mirrors
# tracked files into the web root — a screenshot of the client's site has no
# business being served from it. The logo the site actually uses is the copy at
# mt-logo.webp, which IS tracked.
_brand-source/
